  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund is intended to provide debt and quasi-equity capital to entities in the healthcare space with a view to supporting proven innovations for low-income populations, in order to improve resilience and help attain both the goal of Universal Health Coverage (UHC) on the continent and the Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) #3 focused on Good Health and Wellbeing.</narrative>
